(7255759, 1128148, 159723, '<td valign="top">I like the sky, and the composition is very sweet. For me parts of the sand could need a bit more detail. Is it a bit overexposed? I''m maybe not qualified to comment on it, as I don''t really know how to fix it. I''m still learning :)</td>', 'I like the sky, and the composition is very sweet. For me parts of the sand could need a bit more detail. Is it a bit overexposed? I''m maybe not qualified to comment on it, as I don''t really know how to fix it. I''m still learning :)', '2014-08-27 07:20:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7255760, 1128321, 159723, '<td valign="top">I get a bit distracted by the long straw in front of the balloon. The fern, DOF and the dark colours creates a beautiful mood!</td>', 'I get a bit distracted by the long straw in front of the balloon. The fern, DOF and the dark colours creates a beautiful mood!', '2014-08-27 07:25:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7255804, 1128184, 3102, '<td valign="top">Overall, a nice shot... nice composure, meets the challenge well, etc.  I''m not crazy about the sepia toning, though.  Sepia is a great tool for shots that bring memories of days gone by, but I don''t quite get how it adds to this shot.</td>', 'Overall, a nice shot... nice composure, meets the challenge well, etc.  I''m not crazy about the sepia toning, though.  Sepia is a great tool for shots that bring memories of days gone by, but I don''t quite get how it adds to this shot.', '2014-08-27 11:18:55.000000', NULL, 1),
