(7257258, 1127833, 156466, '<td valign="top">Was almost going to say the sky is overstructured, and am still leaning that way ... but you''ve convinced me.  One of my fav''s from this challenge.</td>', 'Was almost going to say the sky is overstructured, and am still leaning that way ... but you''ve convinced me.  One of my fav''s from this challenge.', '2014-09-01 07:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7257259, 1128307, 156466, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but there''s something about the composition that just isn''t working for me.  My eye wants to wander away from the focal point.</td>', 'Nice idea, but there''s something about the composition that just isn''t working for me.  My eye wants to wander away from the focal point.', '2014-09-01 07:34:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7257260, 1127861, 156466, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene that seems to have lost something in post-processing.  A little more color and a little less noise?</td>', 'Beautiful scene that seems to have lost something in post-processing.  A little more color and a little less noise?', '2014-09-01 07:35:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7257264, 1128204, 156466, '<td valign="top">Perhaps a slightly different treatment?  Even just bringing in your blacks and whites - this is very heavy in the midtones.</td>', 'Perhaps a slightly different treatment?  Even just bringing in your blacks and whites - this is very heavy in the midtones.', '2014-09-01 07:38:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7257267, 1128218, 156466, '<td valign="top">Perspective and composition don''t work for me.  Chair and/or rotation to the left might change that.  Otherwise, I really like the treatment.</td>', 'Perspective and composition don''t work for me.  Chair and/or rotation to the left might change that.  Otherwise, I really like the treatment.', '2014-09-01 07:40:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7257271, 1128317, 156466, '<td valign="top">I think you could have done more to bring out the details in the balloon during B&amp;W conversion, and in the flowers.  Did you simply desaturate?  Hue differential is almost complete lost.</td>', 'I think you could have done more to bring out the details in the balloon during B&W conversion, and in the flowers.  Did you simply desaturate?  Hue differential is almost complete lost.', '2014-09-01 07:42:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7257272, 1128233, 156466, '<td valign="top">Crop is a little tight on the sides and her face needs to be brought out of the shadows a bit.</td>', 'Crop is a little tight on the sides and her face needs to be brought out of the shadows a bit.', '2014-09-01 07:43:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7257273, 1127787, 156466, '<td valign="top">It''s hard to tell with the taped on lines, but this feels like it was shot from the right side looking left and in a crop like this is just feels funny.  Horizontal perspective correction (about 6%) in post would have fixed that rather easily.</td>', 'It''s hard to tell with the taped on lines, but this feels like it was shot from the right side looking left and in a crop like this is just feels funny.  Horizontal perspective correction (about 6%) in post would have fixed that rather easily.', '2014-09-01 07:46:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7257274, 1128314, 156466, '<td valign="top">Been there.  Nice capture.</td>', 'Been there.  Nice capture.', '2014-09-01 07:46:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7257275, 1128209, 156466, '<td valign="top">Not a huge fan of the final light treatment.  It''s nice, and I suspect you''re not far off, but there''s something that doesn''t quite feel right with the mix of shadows and light.  Perhaps just pulling in the whites in a levels adjustment.  And maybe a bit of room at the bottom?  Still, I like it - just don''t love it.</td>', 'Not a huge fan of the final light treatment.  It''s nice, and I suspect you''re not far off, but there''s something that doesn''t quite feel right with the mix of shadows and light.  Perhaps just pulling in the whites in a levels adjustment.  And maybe a bit of room at the bottom?  Still, I like it - just don''t love it.', '2014-09-01 07:50:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7257280, 1128309, 156466, '<td valign="top">Love the balloon.  Something weird and distracting going on with the light and color on the arms, particularly the one in the rear.  A different treatment or a different crop might have been better - just enough to show the other hand but remove the weird lighting/color.  Tighter crop would have highlighted the balloon a little more as well.  7 that could have been higher.</td>', 'Love the balloon.  Something weird and distracting going on with the light and color on the arms, particularly the one in the rear.  A different treatment or a different crop might have been better - just enough to show the other hand but remove the weird lighting/color.  Tighter crop would have highlighted the balloon a little more as well.  7 that could have been higher.', '2014-09-01 08:17:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7257281, 1128290, 156466, '<td valign="top">Lovely, but it''s too much negative space at the top for me.</td>', 'Lovely, but it''s too much negative space at the top for me.', '2014-09-01 08:18:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7257282, 1128083, 156466, '<td valign="top">Composition and perspective just don''t work for me.  Lots of great stuff in there that would have worked with a little more thought put into the shot.</td>', 'Composition and perspective just don''t work for me.  Lots of great stuff in there that would have worked with a little more thought put into the shot.', '2014-09-01 08:19:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7257284, 1128263, 156466, '<td valign="top">Great colors and light.</td>', 'Great colors and light.', '2014-09-01 08:20:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7257287, 1128184, 156466, '<td valign="top">I find myself feeling as confined as he does.  It a cool setting and nice treatment, but something just doesn''t work in the composition for me.  I think it''s those branches in the upper right corner.  Perhaps pulling in from the right to lose those foreground branches (4:5 crop)?  This also puts the biker off center and gives him somewhere to "go" in the shot besides forward.  I''m not a strict rule of thirds guy, but I think this shot would have really benefited from having him closer/on a right 3rd line.  Still a 7.</td>', 'I find myself feeling as confined as he does.  It a cool setting and nice treatment, but something just doesn''t work in the composition for me.  I think it''s those branches in the upper right corner.  Perhaps pulling in from the right to lose those foreground branches (4:5 crop)?  This also puts the biker off center and gives him somewhere to "go" in the shot besides forward.  I''m not a strict rule of thirds guy, but I think this shot would have really benefited from having him closer/on a right 3rd line.  Still a 7.', '2014-09-01 08:28:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7257288, 1128148, 156466, '<td valign="top">I think I''d like this better in a non-square crop.</td>', 'I think I''d like this better in a non-square crop.', '2014-09-01 08:29:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7257290, 1127761, 156466, '<td valign="top">Not a fan of the title (not that I don''t get it - it just never occurred to me looking at the photo), but I''m a big fan of the shot.  Elegantly simple, perfectly lit, and makes me mad that I didn''t think of it.</td>', 'Not a fan of the title (not that I don''t get it - it just never occurred to me looking at the photo), but I''m a big fan of the shot.  Elegantly simple, perfectly lit, and makes me mad that I didn''t think of it.', '2014-09-01 08:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7257584, 1128297, 37858, '<td valign="top">My choice for the blue.</td>', 'My choice for the blue.', '2014-09-01 23:27:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7257586, 1128033, 37858, '<td valign="top">One of my favorite three images.</td>', 'One of my favorite three images.', '2014-09-01 23:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7257587, 1128012, 37858, '<td valign="top">Top Ten for sure.</td>', 'Top Ten for sure.', '2014-09-01 23:28:23.000000', NULL, 1),
