(7257589, 1128309, 37858, '<td valign="top">Very interesting lighting.  Works well on the balloon but the back of the forearm looks a bit odd to me.  Still...I predict a top ten finish.</td>', 'Very interesting lighting.  Works well on the balloon but the back of the forearm looks a bit odd to me.  Still...I predict a top ten finish.', '2014-09-01 23:29:53.000000', NULL, 1),
