(7257593, 1128188, 37858, '<td valign="top">What''s not to like about this image?  Now if you had only been on board and started photographing the view from there.  Still, good marks from me.</td>', 'What''s not to like about this image?  Now if you had only been on board and started photographing the view from there.  Still, good marks from me.', '2014-09-01 23:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
