(7258168, 1128314, 12611, '<td valign="top">Great Job Shannon. When I heard "Balloon Festival" on the radio, I first thought it was the festival held in Goshen- but it was Plainfield. You did a great job sourcing this out and finding a unique shot.</td>', 'Great Job Shannon. When I heard "Balloon Festival" on the radio, I first thought it was the festival held in Goshen- but it was Plainfield. You did a great job sourcing this out and finding a unique shot.', '2014-09-03 10:13:29.000000', NULL, 0),
