(7258171, 1127761, 175946, '<td valign="top">I am shocked this did not finish much, much higher. Brilliant concept, superbly executed, great contrast, tack sharp, perfect symmetry, great use of negative space, nicely exposed, pleasing color and great choice against the absolutely solid black background. Perhaps there is just a fine line between insanity and genius. I see it on the genius side.</td>', 'I am shocked this did not finish much, much higher. Brilliant concept, superbly executed, great contrast, tack sharp, perfect symmetry, great use of negative space, nicely exposed, pleasing color and great choice against the absolutely solid black background. Perhaps there is just a fine line between insanity and genius. I see it on the genius side.', '2014-09-03 10:18:11.000000', NULL, 0),
